## Red Smoke "Danger Close" (IDEA-46, rules/red-smoke.yaml)

actor-redsmoke =
    .power-name = Red Smoke
    .power-description = Your nearest soldier throws a red smoke canister.
    After 4 seconds, your idle artillery, rocket launchers, ships
    and up to 4 attack aircraft fire on the smoke for 20 seconds.
    The cloud drifts with the wind, and the fire follows it.
    The enemy can see the smoke too.

actor-smoke-red =
    .name = Red Smoke

notification-red-smoke-ready = Red smoke ready.
notification-red-smoke-fire-mission = Fire mission: support is firing on the red smoke.
notification-red-smoke-no-support = No support in range of the red smoke.
notification-red-smoke-spotted = Enemy red smoke spotted. Incoming fire!
